1
00:00:00,980 --> 00:00:03,210
(Penny:)I want to believe you.
I really do.

2
00:00:03,215 --> 00:00:05,585
(Penny:)Am I being naive?

3
00:00:05,584 --> 00:00:07,254
(Bernadette:)Oh, I don't know.

4
00:00:07,253 --> 00:00:09,183
(Bernadette:)This is all so new to me.

5
00:00:09,188 --> 00:00:12,118
(Bernadette:)I'm still processing.

6
00:00:12,124 --> 00:00:15,064
(Penny:)You know, he never would've
done this when we first met.

7
00:00:15,061 --> 00:00:16,331
(Penny:)He's cockier now.

8
00:00:16,328 --> 00:00:18,358
(Amy:)That's because you made him
more confident.

9
00:00:18,364 --> 00:00:20,994
(Bernadette:)You know, if you think about it,
without you,

10
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:23,300
(Bernadette:)he never would've grown
into the person he is now.

11
00:00:23,302 --> 00:00:26,102
(Bernadette:)I mean, sure,
more women might notice him,

12
00:00:26,105 --> 00:00:28,175
(Bernadette:)but I think it's better
to have a guy be with you

13
00:00:28,174 --> 00:00:29,644
(Bernadette:)because he wants to be

14
00:00:29,642 --> 00:00:31,912
(Bernadette:)and not because he thinks he
doesn't have any other choice.

15
00:00:31,911 --> 00:00:34,281
(Penny:)I never thought
about it like that.

16
00:00:34,280 --> 00:00:36,950
(Bernadette:)Oh, me neither,
not until just now.

17
00:00:39,185 --> 00:00:41,885
Hello. I'm Dr. Sheldon Cooper,

18
00:00:41,887 --> 00:00:44,857
and welcome to "Sheldon Cooper
Presents: Fun With Flags."

19
00:00:44,857 --> 00:00:47,787
You may notice that
I'm holding a remote control.

20
00:00:47,793 --> 00:00:50,323
That's because my cameraperson
and co-host,

21
00:00:50,329 --> 00:00:51,859
Dr. Amy Farrah Fowler,

22
00:00:51,864 --> 00:00:54,994
has chosen to end
her relationship with me.

23
00:00:56,802 --> 00:01:06,022
I'm going to pause here
to let that sink in.

